    "summary": "Somali physicians provided free medical care to around 1,000 patients at Vijibweni Hospital in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania, as part of the EAC Armed Forces Civil-Military Cooperation Week. The initiative, running from August 26 to September 1, 2026, was observed by EAC military officials during a visit.",
